    'Kemadruma': { title: 'Kemadruma Yoga (with cancellation factors to assess)', text: 'No planets other than the Sun occupy the signs on either side of your Moon, which the classics call Kemadruma Yoga. In its raw form it indicates periods of loneliness, mental restlessness and fluctuating fortune. In practice this yoga is cancelled or greatly reduced when the Moon is aspected by Jupiter, when planets occupy kendras from the Moon, or when the Moon is strong by sign. Treat this as a call to build emotional self-reliance and a stable routine rather than as a sentence; many who carry this yoga achieve great independence precisely because they learned early to stand alone.' },
